<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2363"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Foxtrotnem<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Foxtrotnem<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 20, 2004 - 12:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->somebody in carol moulds husbands family was suspected as being btk in the 80s but nothing came of the investigation....what if it was her husband that was suspected and she found out????<!--/Text--></td></tr>
