<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3159"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 31, 2004 - 2:27 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Some other interesting articles on this case: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.ksffa.com/September%20Firenews/fire_claims_life_of_benton_woman.htm" target=_top>http://www.ksffa.com/September%20Firenews/fire_cla ims_life_of_benton_woman.htm</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.ksffa.com/September%20Firenews/fire_fatality_now_murder.htm" target=_top>http://www.ksffa.com/September%20Firenews/fire_fat ality_now_murder.htm</a> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
