<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3160"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, December 31, 2004 - 2:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Some articles relating to Douglas E. Mould <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/eagle/living/columnists/tom_schaefer/5132647.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/eagle/living/columnists/ tom_schaefer/5132647.htm</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.ipt-forensics.com/journal/volume9/j9_3_3.htm" target=_top>http://www.ipt-forensics.com/journal/volume9/j9_3_ 3.htm</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.menweb.org/throop/falsereport/sources/jhopkins.html" target=_top>http://www.menweb.org/throop/falsereport/sources/j hopkins.html</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://caselaw.lp.findlaw.com/scripts/getcase.pl?court=ks&amp;vol=supct/2002/20020419/&amp;invol=86641" target=_top>http://caselaw.lp.findlaw.com/scripts/getcase.pl?c ourt=ks&amp;vol=supct/2002/20020419/&amp;invol=86641</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
